      <p begin="00:17.220" end="00:19.970" ttm:agent="v1">You see how we living</p>
      <p begin="00:19.970" end="00:24.710" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:24.710" end="00:29.610" ttm:agent="v1">I'm tryna keep it as simple as possible</p>
      <p begin="00:29.610" end="00:32.640" ttm:agent="v1">You know what I do</p>
